EngineSim third-party notices
=============================

Vendored sources under Sources/EngineSimCore/upstream/ come from:

1. engine-sim, https://github.com/ange-yaghi/engine-sim
   Commit 85f7c3b959a908ed5232ede4f1a4ac7eafe6b630
   Vendored: core simulation sources (src/*.cpp for the physics, combustion,
   synthesizer and filters) and their headers. Excluded: UI, delta-studio,
   piranha/scripting and Discord integration.

2. simple-2d-constraint-solver, https://github.com/ange-yaghi/simple-2d-constraint-solver
   Commit e009f4ff1c9c4c5874e865e893cdb62e208fb2b3 (the engine-sim submodule pin)
   Vendored: include/ and src/.

Also derived from engine-sim:
- Sources/EngineSimCore/ls_v8_builder.cpp is a C++ hand port of
  assets/engines/atg-video-2/07_gm_ls.mr and the script node logic.
- Sources/EngineSimCore/ls_v8_impulse_response.cpp embeds
  assets/sound-library/smooth/smooth_39.wav.

Local modifications to upstream files (see upstream/LOCAL_PATCHES.diff):
- include/constants.h, include/units.h: `extern constexpr` -> `inline constexpr`
  so the constants link in more than one translation unit under clang.
- include/gas_system.h: user-provided Mix() constructor, which clang requires to
  use `Mix` as a default argument inside GasSystem.
Everything else is byte-identical to the pinned commits. Compatibility shims
live beside upstream in Sources/EngineSimCore/compat/.

